docs {
  Returns the profile, API key prefix, subscription, 2FA state and effective permissions of the authenticated user.

  Reference: https://docs.veriko.mx/en/v1/users/my-profile
  Guide: https://docs.veriko.mx/en/how-to/inspect-my-account
